{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1321"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge music-stage/theatre","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/zz-r2-music-stage__theatre.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",898],["-","with"],["+","by"],["=",1],["-","a"],["+","having"],["=",1],["-","purple"],["+","precious"],["=",1],["-","carpet"],["+","crimson"],["=",1],["+","cloths spread from his chariot to the palace door, so that his feet need not touch the ground. Agamemnon hesitates, fearing that only gods should walk on such finery, but gives in – "],["=",2],["+","Clytemnestra "],["=",25],["+"," The scene is the earliest known mention in writing of the red carpet, which today is rolled out for every film premiere and state visit."],["=",260]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",884],["-","ihn"],["+","ihn,"],["=",1],["-","mit"],["+","indem"],["=",1],["-","einem"],["+","sie"],["=",1],["-","Purpurteppich"],["+","kostbare"],["=",1],["+","purpurrote Tücher vom Wagen bis zum Palasttor ausbreiten lässt, damit sein Fuß nicht den Boden berührt. Agamemnon zögert, weil er fürchtet, dass nur Götter über solche Pracht schreiten dürfen, gibt aber nach – "],["=",2],["+","Klytaimnestra "],["=",23],["+"," In dieser Szene wird zum ersten Mal schriftlich erwähnt, was heute bei jeder Filmpremiere und jedem Staatsbesuch ausgerollt wird: der rote Teppich."],["=",266]]}]},
